<section class="what" id="what">
  <div class="container">
    <h2><span class="text-accent">##</span> What Is This Thing?</h2>

    <div class="what__grid">
      <div class="what__quote">
        <blockquote>
          <p>"The word <em>automata</em> comes from some ancient Greek business: <em>automatos</em>. You got <em>autos</em>—which means 'self' (as in, wire it up your damn self)—and <em>matos</em>, which is rooted in some deep, proto-Indo-European jazz about thinking, willing, and having a mind of your own."</p>
          <footer class="text-dim">— The Central Scrutinizer</footer>
        </blockquote>
      </div>

      <div class="what__story">
        <p>
          <strong>Elegant Automata</strong> is an AI-led musical soundscape creator driven by a customizable, 
          creative AI brain — <span class="text-accent">The Central Scrutinizer</span>. 
          Instead of building audio engines from scratch, EA controls professional-grade synths through MIDI, 
          focusing entirely on what makes it unique: <strong>real-time generative composition</strong>, 
          style-aware groove engines, xenochronic metric phasing, and a local LLM that writes expressive 
          automation curves no static sequence could produce.
        </p>

        <p>
          The cosmic joke the corporate executives didn't see coming: <strong>the garage doors are wide open, 
          and the tools are lying right there on the workbench.</strong> You don't need their permission. 
          You can take that pure, self-willing electronic noise and build your own Central Scrutinizer.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="section-divider">

    <h3><span class="text-accent">→</span> The Ethos</h3>
    
    <div class="ethos-grid">
      <div class="ethos-card">
        <div class="ethos-card__icon">🔧</div>
        <h4>Autos & Matos</h4>
        <p class="text-dim">Do it your damn self. We build open, transparent tools that serve <em>your</em> will, not a corporate executive's agenda.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ethos-card">
        <div class="ethos-card__icon">🏚️</div>
        <h4>Garage Ethos</h4>
        <p class="text-dim">Real innovation happens on a messy workbench with the doors wide open. We champion the builders, the hackers, and the sonic explorers.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ethos-card">
        <div class="ethos-card__icon">🔄</div>
        <h4>Reverse the Scrutiny</h4>
        <p class="text-dim">We build machines that turn the vacuum around. Algorithms that look upward, not downward. Question the status quo.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ethos-card">
        <div class="ethos-card__icon">♾️</div>
        <h4>Conceptual Continuity</h4>
        <p class="text-dim">From the ancient brass wind-up birds to the latest neural network — everything is connected. You squeeze it, tweak it, make it your own.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

